   - RoadConditionRisk: 0.85 (high due to fog reducing overall visibility and increasing collision potential) Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyRoadWithRedReflectionAnomaly" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Red reflective surface causing visual distortion" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition ;
    :description "Heavy fog reducing visibility" .

:risk1 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Visual distortion from red reflection on vehicle surface" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

